  "releaseNotes": "feat(routing): add default AuthToken property to IRoutable interface\n\n      - Add `ReadOnlySpan<byte> AuthToken => []` with Default Interface Implementation (DII)\n      - Decouple SessionMiddleware from HTTP-specific RequestModel semantics\n      - Enable protocol-agnostic authorization support (HTTP, Custom Binary, WebSocket)\n      - Preserve zero-allocation pipeline and zero breaking changes for existing routables",
